  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPractice Management \n\t\tPractice Management Help Guide\n\n### How to set up custom templates for Letters of Engagement/Proposals\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Mon, 5 Oct, 2020 at  4:33 PM\n\n\t\tLocation: Practice Management module > Settings > Document Templates\n\nRefer to the link\n\nHelp/Guide: \n\nOnce in Document Templates, click 'New Template'\n\nEnter the Template name, choose between an Engagement or Proposal Letter and click Continue \n\nPaste your custom Letter of Engagement/Proposal template here and ensure to not delete any of the tags which are as follows; [proposal.price_summary], [practice.name], [client.name], [proposal.commencement_date] & [proposal.end_date].  Insert those tags in areas that are grammatically correct as the system will use the tags to pick up information about the client and/or your practice.\n\nPaste your custom email here, again ensure none of the tags are deleted. Once happy, click save.\n\nClick here to watch how to set up Custom Proposal/LOE Templates\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115348\">Practice Management </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188563\">Practice Management Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to set up custom templates for Letters of Engagement/Proposals\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Mon, 5 Oct, 2020 at  4:33 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p><strong>Location:</strong> Practice Management module &gt; Settings &gt; Document Templates</p><p><a href=\"https://appv4.capium.com/#/crm/document-templates\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Refer to the link</a></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Help/Guide:</strong> </p><p>Once in Document Templates, click 'New Template'</p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9112708294/original/Inml6hvbEVmjLJmoUgvScKNIJ-f-M7mFNg.png?1601911936\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9112708294\"></p><p><br></p><p>Enter the Template name, choose between an Engagement or Proposal Letter and click Continue </p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9112708441/original/ctuKHuj-SaamZk4MRxtmTzLVu3Uj1U0P0w.png?1601912007\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9112708441\"></p><p><br></p><p>Paste your custom Letter of Engagement/Proposal template here and ensure to not delete any of the tags which are as follows; <strong>[proposal.price_summary], <strong>[practice.name],</strong><span style=\"font-size:11pt;\"><span style=\"text-justify:inter-ideograph;\"> </span></span><strong>[client.name], <strong>[proposal.commencement_date]</strong> &amp; <strong>[proposal.end_date]</strong>.</strong>  </strong>Insert those tags in areas that are grammatically correct as the system will use the tags to pick up information about the client and/or your practice.<strong><br></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9081331454/original/Akh6IVq_9jhRFUHmo0WKOnHS41BuBYdNrw.png?1562603023\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii fr-fil\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9081331454/original/Akh6IVq_9jhRFUHmo0WKOnHS41BuBYdNrw.png?1562603023\" data-fileid=\"9081331454\" data-uniquekey=\"1562602332915\" style=\"width: 731px; height: 343.882px;\" width=\"602\"></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Paste your custom email here, again ensure none of the tags are deleted. Once happy, click save.</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9081572789/original/YCLGTgToIgJoCEc753cPSy73vBEFcNDtbQ.png?1562842361\" data-fileid=\"9081572789\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9081572789/original/YCLGTgToIgJoCEc753cPSy73vBEFcNDtbQ.png?1562842361\" data-uniquekey=\"1562842322920\" style=\"width: 727px;\" width=\"602\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/e008a8ea80aa41b4acfebb934b8fa916\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><br></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/3662487ec21441309ae7d722bf98537e\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to watch how to set up Custom Proposal/LOE Templates</a></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000172255\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000172255/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000172255\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000172255/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000172255\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\" data-hide-dom=\"#vote-feedback-form-link\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">Send feedback</a><div id=\"vote-feedback-container\"class=\"hide\">\t<div class=\"lead\">Sorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.</div>\t<div id=\"vote-feedback-form\">\t\t<div class=\"sloading loading-small loading-block\"></div>\t</div></div>\n\t\t\n"
